CLI brok.","/pt-br/docs/ide","ide.mdx","pt-br:_2","pt-br:integrations.md","Integrations","Brokspace stays small and plugs into the tools you already use.","/pt-br/docs/integrations","integrations.md","pt-br:shards.md","Shards","Shards are small programs that react to workspace events.","/pt-br/docs/shards","shards.md","pt-br:skills.md","Skills","A skill is a small, reusable workflow written for AI agents: a folder with a SKILL.md (YAML frontmatter name + description, then instructions) and optional reference files.","/pt-br/docs/skills","skills.md","pt-br:local-llm.md","Local LLM setup","Brokspace answers questions (brok ask) and runs skills (brok skill run) with any OpenAI-compatible model.","/pt-br/docs/local-llm","pt-br:_1","Guias","pt-br:getting-started.md","Getting started with Brokspace","From zero to a productive workspace in about 15 minutes.","/pt-br/docs/getting-started","getting-started.md","pt-br:index.mdx","Introdução","O Brokspace deixa qualquer workspace de desenvolvimento pesquisável e pronto para agentes, na sua máquina.","/pt-br/docs","index.mdx","pt-br:_0","Início","folder","","meta","meta.json"]
